     3838   ON CHOOSE OF b-filter-ext IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3839   DO:
     3840     if r-2 = 1 then r-2 = 2 .
     3841                else r-2 = 1.
     3842     if r-2 = 2 then do:
     3843        find first gds-list-flt where gds-list-flt.gds-code = 0 no-error .
     3844        if available gds-list-flt then delete gds-list-flt.
