     3959     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('is-sum', '', '',    input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3960     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('qnty', '', '',      input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3961     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('prc', '', '',       input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3962     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('price-cli', '', '',  input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3963     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('sum-cli', '', '',    input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3964     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('income-qnty', '', '', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3965     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('income-sum-base', 'Сумма по накл в б.в.', '', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3966     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('income-sum-rubl', '', '', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     3967   Filter-Block:
     3968   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     3969       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     3970       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
